&lt;p&gt;From: Alice, To: Ruby Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Picture Info: Christina Church. Toluca, Illinois&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Toluca, Illinois on July 1, 1908&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Ruby Chandler&lt;br&gt;
801 Hester Avenue&lt;br&gt;
Normal, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dear Ruby&lt;br&gt;
Why haven’t you written home? I have been waiting for this pictures. Have you enjoyed your onions? I have been to the country this week.&lt;br&gt;
Alice&lt;/p&gt;</description>
